---
import { ArrowRight } from 'lucide-astro';
---

<section class="brand-gradient relative overflow-hidden py-20 sm:py-24">
	<div
		class="absolute inset-0 opacity-10"
		style="background-image: radial-gradient(circle at 1px 1px, #fff 1px, transparent 0); background-size: 2rem 2rem;"
		aria-hidden="true"
	></div>
	<div class="relative mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 text-center sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
		<h2 class="reveal text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-4xl">
			Vamos construir a solução da sua empresa?
		</h2>
		<p class="reveal mx-auto mt-4 max-w-xl text-lg text-white/85">
			Conte o que você precisa. A gente desenha o caminho mais curto entre a sua
			dor e o software que resolve.
		</p>
		<a
			href="/#contato"
			class="reveal mt-8 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-white px-8 py-4 text-base font-bold text-primary shadow-xl transition-transform hover:scale-[1.03]"
		>
			Fale com a gente
			<ArrowRight class="h-5 w-5" aria-hidden="true" />
		</a>
	</div>
</section>
